CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.review_preorder_atomic(_id uuid, _action text, _actor uuid, _note text, _items jsonb, _totals jsonb) RETURNS jsonb LANGUAGE plpgsql SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path = public AS $$ DECLARE po public.pre_orders; doc public.billing_documents; line jsonb; idx integer := 0; uid uuid; BEGIN IF NOT public.has_role(_actor,'superuser') THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Only a superuser can review pre-orders'; END IF; SELECT * INTO po FROM public.pre_orders WHERE id=_id FOR UPDATE; IF po.id IS NULL OR po.status <> 'PENDING_APPROVAL' THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Pre-order is no longer pending'; END IF; SELECT user_id INTO uid FROM public.customers WHERE id=po.customer_id; IF _action='reject' THEN UPDATE public.pre_orders SET status='REJECTED', review_note=_note, reviewed_by=_actor, reviewed_at=now() WHERE id=_id; INSERT INTO public.notifications(user_id,title,body,link) VALUES(uid,'Pre-order rejected',_note,'/user/orders'); RETURN jsonb_build_object('ok',true); END IF; IF _action <> 'approve' OR jsonb_array_length(_items) < 1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Invalid review'; END IF; INSERT INTO public.billing_documents(doc_type,customer_id,notes,created_by,subtotal,dpp,vat,stamp_duty,total) VALUES('QUO',po.customer_id,'From pre-order. '||coalesce(po.notes,''),_actor,(_totals->>'subtotal')::numeric,(_totals->>'dpp')::numeric,(_totals->>'vat')::numeric,(_totals->>'stamp_duty')::numeric,(_totals->>'total')::numeric) RETURNING * INTO doc; FOR line IN SELECT value FROM jsonb_array_elements(_items) LOOP INSERT INTO public.billing_items(document_id,description,quantity,unit_price,amount,sort_order) VALUES(doc.id,line->>'description',(line->>'quantity')::numeric,(line->>'unit_price')::numeric,round((line->>'quantity')::numeric*(line->>'unit_price')::numeric),idx); idx:=idx+1; END LOOP; UPDATE public.pre_orders SET status='APPROVED', quotation_id=doc.id, review_note=_note, reviewed_by=_actor, reviewed_at=now() WHERE id=po.id; INSERT INTO public.notifications(user_id,title,body,link) VALUES(uid,'Pre-order approved','Quotation '||doc.doc_number||' is being prepared.','/user/orders'); INSERT INTO public.audit_logs(actor_id,action,entity_type,entity_id) VALUES(_actor,'preorder.approve','pre_order',po.id); RETURN jsonb_build_object('ok',true,'docNumber',doc.doc_number); END $$;
REVOKE ALL ON FUNCTION public.review_preorder_atomic(uuid,text,uuid,text,jsonb,jsonb) FROM PUBLIC,anon,authenticated;
GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION public.review_preorder_atomic(uuid,text,uuid,text,jsonb,jsonb) TO service_role;
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.replace_monitor_assignments(_monitor_id uuid, _customer_ids uuid[]) RETURNS void LANGUAGE plpgsql SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path = public AS $$ BEGIN IF NOT public.is_staff(auth.uid()) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Staff required'; END IF; PERFORM 1 FROM public.network_monitors WHERE id=_monitor_id FOR UPDATE; IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Monitor not found'; END IF; DELETE FROM public.monitor_assignments WHERE monitor_id=_monitor_id AND NOT(customer_id=ANY(_customer_ids)); INSERT INTO public.monitor_assignments(monitor_id,customer_id) SELECT _monitor_id,id FROM unnest(_customer_ids) id ON CONFLICT(monitor_id,customer_id) DO NOTHING; END $$;
REVOKE ALL ON FUNCTION public.replace_monitor_assignments(uuid,uuid[]) FROM PUBLIC,anon;
GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION public.replace_monitor_assignments(uuid,uuid[]) TO authenticated,service_role;
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.apply_billing_stage(_id uuid, _stage text, _title text, _body text) RETURNS boolean LANGUAGE plpgsql SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path = public AS $$ DECLARE doc public.billing_documents; uid uuid; stages text[]:=ARRAY['REMIND_7','REMIND_3','OVERDUE_1','SUSPEND_7','TERMINATE_30']; days integer; expected text; BEGIN SELECT * INTO doc FROM public.billing_documents WHERE id=_id FOR UPDATE; IF doc.id IS NULL OR doc.doc_type<>'INV' OR doc.status NOT IN ('APPROVED','SENT') OR doc.due_date IS NULL THEN RETURN false; END IF; days:=(now() AT TIME ZONE 'UTC')::date-doc.due_date; expected:=CASE WHEN days>=30 THEN 'TERMINATE_30' WHEN days>=7 THEN 'SUSPEND_7' WHEN days>=1 THEN 'OVERDUE_1' WHEN days>=-3 THEN 'REMIND_3' WHEN days>=-7 THEN 'REMIND_7' ELSE NULL END; IF expected IS NULL OR expected<>_stage OR coalesce(array_position(stages,doc.lifecycle_stage),0)>=array_position(stages,_stage) THEN RETURN false; END IF; SELECT user_id INTO uid FROM public.customers WHERE id=doc.customer_id; IF _stage='SUSPEND_7' THEN UPDATE public.customers SET status='SUSPENDED' WHERE id=doc.customer_id; UPDATE public.user_services SET status='SUSPENDED',suspended_at=now() WHERE customer_id=doc.customer_id AND status='ACTIVE'; ELSIF _stage='TERMINATE_30' THEN UPDATE public.customers SET status='SUSPENDED' WHERE id=doc.customer_id; UPDATE public.user_services SET status='TERMINATED',terminated_at=now() WHERE customer_id=doc.customer_id AND status<>'TERMINATED'; END IF; INSERT INTO public.notifications(user_id,title,body,link) VALUES(uid,_title,_body,'/user/billing'); UPDATE public.billing_documents SET lifecycle_stage=_stage WHERE id=doc.id; INSERT INTO public.audit_logs(action,entity_type,entity_id) VALUES('lifecycle.'||_stage,'billing_document',doc.id); RETURN true; END $$;
REVOKE ALL ON FUNCTION public.apply_billing_stage(uuid,text,text,text) FROM PUBLIC,anon,authenticated;
GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION public.apply_billing_stage(uuid,text,text,text) TO service_role;
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.notify_ticket_message() RETURNS trigger LANGUAGE plpgsql SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=public AS $$ BEGIN IF NEW.is_staff THEN INSERT INTO public.notifications(user_id,title,body,link) SELECT c.user_id,'Reply on '||t.ticket_no,left(NEW.body,160),'/user/tickets' FROM public.tickets t JOIN public.customers c ON c.id=t.customer_id WHERE t.id=NEW.ticket_id; ELSE INSERT INTO public.notifications(user_id,title,body,link) SELECT DISTINCT r.user_id,'Customer reply on '||t.ticket_no,left(NEW.body,160),'/backend/tickets' FROM public.user_roles r CROSS JOIN public.tickets t WHERE r.role IN ('superuser','admin','operator') AND public.account_enabled(r.user_id) AND t.id=NEW.ticket_id; END IF; RETURN NEW; END $$;